-- ext:[KT 12422 p.2196א, read from the page image] | (18י)
-- ext:[KT 12422 p.2196א, read from the page image] | כ"ג בסיוון התשפ"ו (8 ביוני 2026)
-- ext:[KT 12422 cover, read from the page image] | 9 ביוני 2026
-- ext:[KT 12422 cover, read from the page image] | כ"ד בסיוון התשפ"ו
-- FROM WHEN. The order's page has no section on commencement, so the day it started is not in the instrument. The consolidation's editorial notes say it ran for two years from 9.6.2026; that day is the Wikisource
-- editor's reading, NOT the instrument's, and is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY. The note on the second (18ט) also says the numbering is wrong in the source; that is the editor's note too (the heading lines 729 and 732 of the page
-- both print (18ט), and the editor gave the second an anchor of its own).
-- src:733 | [note: (הוראת שעה לשנתיים מיום 9.6.2026; ספרור שגוי במקור):]
-- src:736 | [note: (הוראת שעה לשנתיים מיום 9.6.2026):]
-- THE ACT. Sefer HaChukim 3571 (27 July 2026) p. 985, read from the page image. Its s 27 adds one item to the First Schedule after item (18ח); this row does not quote or discuss that item's text.
-- Its s 28(א) starts the item 18 months after the Act's publication, which is 27 January 2028; its s 28(ב) lets a Minister postpone the start by order, with a Knesset committee's approval, by up to a year.
-- Both are paraphrases of the page, not quotations. NO postponement order was looked for, so 27 January 2028 is the day as enacted and is not known to be the day it started.
-- ext:[SH 3571 p.985, read from the page image] | אחרי פרט (18ח) יבוא
-- ext:[SH 3571 p.985, read from the page image] | (18ט)
-- ext:[SH 3571 cover, read from the text layer; the cover image was not looked at] | 27 ביולי 2026
-- ext:[SH 3571 cover, read from the text layer; the cover image was not looked at] | י"ג באב התשפ"ו
-- The consolidation's note on the Act's item agrees with that day (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY):
-- src:730 | [note: (החל מיום 27.1.2028):]
-- ASSUMED, NOT RULED (fork P1 in NOTES.md): two years counted from the editor's day end on 8 or 9 June 2028 by either usual count; the row records the earlier, 8 June 2028, as the first day the order's items
-- COULD be over, a lower bound and not a finding. The row does not make the count.
`item: first item of the 2026 order, label (18ט)` MEANS
    `A schedule item` WITH
        `the label printed` IS "(18ט)"
        `the item is placed after` IS "(18ח)"
        `the item is added by` IS "the order in Kovetz HaTakanot 12422, p. 2196א"
        `the first day it is read` IS JUST (Date 9 6 2026)
        `how long it is read` IS `for two years, a count this row does not make`
        `the first day it could be over` IS JUST (Date 8 6 2028)
        `the first day was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `the length was read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

`item: second item of the 2026 order, label (18י)` MEANS
    `A schedule item` WITH
        `the label printed` IS "(18י)"
        `the item is placed after` IS "(18ט)"
        `the item is added by` IS "the order in Kovetz HaTakanot 12422, p. 2196א"
        `the first day it is read` IS JUST (Date 9 6 2026)
        `how long it is read` IS `for two years, a count this row does not make`
        `the first day it could be over` IS JUST (Date 8 6 2028)
        `the first day was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `the length was read from` IS `the official instrument, read from its page image`

`item: item added by s 27 of SH 3571, label (18ט)` MEANS
    `A schedule item` WITH
        `the label printed` IS "(18ט)"
        `the item is placed after` IS "(18ח)"
        `the item is added by` IS "section 27 of Sefer HaChukim 3571, p. 985"
        `the first day it is read` IS JUST (Date 27 1 2028)
        `how long it is read` IS `to no end that the instrument which adds it states`
        `the first day it could be over` IS NOTHING
        `the first day was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
        `the length was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`

-- CONTROL 1 is not a record of its own: it is the second item of the order, whose label (18י) differs from the first item's (18ט), and the days before 27 January 2028, on which every label names one item.
-- Both are asserted in ml52-tests-xrefs.l4 from the three values above.

-- DEFECT 2. Item (18ו) to s 7ג(ב) of the Infiltration Law.
-- CITING WORDS (limb b). Read from the page image of Kovetz HaTakanot 7721 (30 October 2016) p. 38, the order that added item (18ו), signed 24 Elul 5776 = 27 September 2016 (calendar routine) and starting
-- ten days from its publication. The consolidation prints the same words (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY) and lists three amending instruments for the item, the 5773 and 5774 ones and Kovetz HaTakanot 5777; only the last was read.
-- The text of the 2013 temporary law itself (Sefer HaChukim 5773 p. 78) was NOT read.
