`reference: item (18ו) to s 7ג(ב) of the Infiltration Law` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "First Schedule, item (18ו), the words 'סעיף 7ג(ב) לחוק למניעת הסתננות (עבירות ושיפוט)' and 'המובא בסעיף 1(1)'"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `section 7ג(ב) of the Infiltration Law, in force while the 2013 temporary law brings it in`
        `the target is` IS `section 7ג of the Infiltration Law as its consolidation prints it, with a lapse marker in place of text`
        `the text the citing words name stopped being the text in force on` IS NOTHING
        `the consolidation prints the named text as lapsed` IS TRUE
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`

-- CONTROL 2. The same order of 2016 puts item (18ו) directly after item (18ה). The consolidation prints the two items one after the other, (18ה) at the heading line 717 and (18ו) at the heading line 720
-- (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY: the headings print no text beside the quotation, so the lines are named, not quoted). The words of the order are on the `ext:[KT 7721 p.38 ...]` line above.
`reference: the place after item (18ה), where the 2016 order puts item (18ו)` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "Kovetz HaTakanot 7721, p. 38, section 1: the words that put item (18ו) after item (18ה), quoted on the ext line above"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the place directly after item (18ה) of the First Schedule`
        `the target is` IS `the place directly after item (18ה) of the First Schedule`
        `the text the citing words name stopped being the text in force on` IS NOTHING
        `the consolidation prints the named text as lapsed` IS FALSE
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the consolidation only`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
